    <string name="app_example_dishwasher_a">You put the bowls on the top rack again. They never come out clean up there, that\'s what the bottom is for.</string>
    <string name="app_example_dishwasher_b_name">Sam</string>
    <string name="app_example_dishwasher_b">They fit fine up there and it leaves the bottom free for the pans. I\'ve loaded it like this for years and nothing\'s come out dirty.</string>
